{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45098","headline":"与王录事会张徵君姊妹链师院翫雪兼怀清会上人 · 皎然","name":"与王录事会张徵君姊妹链师院翫雪兼怀清会上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何意廉从事，还来会默仙。\n寒空惊雪徧，春意入歌偏。\n瑶草三花发，琼林七叶连。\n飘颻过柳寺，应满译经前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}